      "sentence_id": 1,
      "japanese": "日本の学校や会社では、４月に新しい年がはじまります。",
      "english_translation": "In schools and companies in Japan, a new year begins in April."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "たとえば、新しく小学校に入る子どもは、４月に「小学１年生」になって、次の年の４月に「小学２年生」になります。",
      "english_translation": "For example, a child starting elementary school for the first time will become a \"first-grade student\" in April and a \"second-grade student\" in April of the following year."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "会社でも、新しく入る人は、基本的には４月に入ります。",
      "english_translation": "In companies, new employees typically start their work in April."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "カレンダー上では、１月から12月が「１年」です。",
      "english_translation": "According to the calendar, from January to December is considered \"one year.\""
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "ですから、１月に「今年は、たくさん旅行に行きたい！」など、「新年の目標」をみんなで話したりします。",
      "english_translation": "Therefore, in January, everyone will discuss their \"New Year's resolutions,\" such as \"This year, I want to travel a lot!\""
    }
  ],
